# Wave T39 (Perennial kit): plateaufloor — Perennial City's
# registered street kind (the fleet's street kinds carry the
# -floor suffix; the desire-path tiers key on it). PARADE
# MARBLE FLAGS: one large ivory marble slab per tile, fine
# gold veining branching across the face, hairline grout at
# the slab edges (top + left, so the tiling reads as big
# flags). Large-format single-slab marble is structurally
# unlike Craterlake's small white setts in dark grout,
# Lastlight's smooth grey veined slabs at cottage scale and
# Blossom's large inlay slabs — this is the league plateau's
# parade surface, warm ivory with gold in the stone.
# (NO-SAME-KIT law; WAVE-T39-PERENNIAL-PLAN.md.)
PIX tile-plateaufloor 16 16
